**Department of Computer Science and Engineering (CSE)**

### Overview:
The Department of Computer Science and Engineering (CSE) was established in 2010. It aims to provide a comprehensive research environment complemented by excellence in teaching. The department is supported by a team of qualified faculty members who encourage students to engage in various extra-curricular and co-curricular activities, ensuring their holistic development and success as engineers. The department emphasizes research and development, fosters innovative ideas, and supports the publication of papers and awards.

### Vision:
To be a globally recognized center for excellence in Computer Science & Engineering education and research, catering to the current needs of the industry and society by producing globally competent and quality computer professionals.

### Mission:
- To produce computer science graduates with sound subject knowledge, certified skill-sets, and the ability to address professional challenges.
- To strengthen department interaction with multinational companies to stay abreast of technological advancements, providing students with opportunities to work with recent tools and technologies.
- To foster professional behavior and leadership abilities, instilling commitment to work culture for national progress, while upholding ethical, moral, and human values.
- To provide practical exposure in various domain areas and undertake research and development activities.
- To develop entrepreneurship and managerial abilities through world-class engineering and management education.

### HOD’s Message:
The HOD welcomes students to the creative world of CSE, emphasizing the discipline's essential role in advancements across all spheres of human endeavor. The department encourages students to excel academically and supports their efforts to publish papers in international journals.

