The Department of Computer Science and Engineering (CSE) at RGUKT Basar was established in 2010. It is dedicated to providing a comprehensive research environment complemented by excellence in teaching. The department is led by a team of qualified faculty members who encourage students to participate in various extra-curricular and co-curricular activities, ensuring their holistic development and success as engineers.

### Vision:
To be a globally recognized center for excellence in Computer Science & Engineering education and research, catering to the current needs of the industry and society by producing globally competent and quality computer professionals.

### Mission:
1. To produce computer science graduates with sound subject knowledge, certified skill-sets, and the ability to address professional challenges.
2. To strengthen department interaction with multinational companies to stay abreast of technological advancements, providing students with opportunities to work with recent tools and technologies.
3. To foster professional behavior and leadership abilities, instilling commitment to work culture for national progress, while upholding ethical, moral, and human values.
4. To provide practical exposure in various domain areas and undertake research and development activities.
5. To develop entrepreneurship and managerial abilities through world-class engineering and management education.

### HOD’s Message:
The Head of the Department, Dr. B. Venkat Raman (M.Tech, Ph.D. pursuing), welcomes students to the creative world of CSE. The department encourages students to publish papers in international journals and supports their achievements in extra-curricular and co-curricular activities. Through an experience-based curriculum, excellent laboratories, and industry-oriented approaches, the department ensures that students are well-prepared for future careers.

For more information, you can contact the HOD at [hod.cse@rgukt.ac.in](mailto:hod.cse@rgukt.ac.in).
